-q-12a904f491b9d053a45f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"西陵战后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-o075a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o075a-q","source_order":[58,353,"O075a"],"order":10395}],"persons":[{"id":"zhanggu-p0018","name":"步璿","evidence":["zhanggu-q-4e6bf5ff89170aad6e55","zhanggu-q-12a904f491b9d053a45f"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o075a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-4a26ea8a0f80eb1773d2","layer":"original","quote":"抗遂陷西陵城；诛夷阐族及其大将吏，自此以下，所请赦者数万口。修治城围，东还乐乡；貌无矜色，谦冲如常，故得将士欢心。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":352,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-72dd776e7f89a6336198","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-fa0fe4a3ed8ad4520955","layer":"original","quote":"阐不应，据城降晋","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-12a904f491b9d053a45f","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-abb819d300d36cb02c9f","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓使陆抗西行，祜等遁退。抗陷城，斩阐等。步氏泯灭，惟璿绍祀","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-4e6bf5ff89170aad6e55","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-924121af7bdd349c256c","layer":"original","quote":"凤凰元年，召为绕帐督。阐累世在西陵，猝被征命，自以失职，又惧有谗祸；于是据城降晋，遣玑弟璿诣洛阳为任〖5〗。晋以阐为都督西陵诸军事，卫将军，仪同三司，加侍中，假节，领交州牧，封宜都公〖6〗；玑监江陵诸军事，左将军，加散骑常侍，领（庐陵）〔庐江〕太守，改封江陵侯；璿给事中，宣威将军〖7〗，封都乡侯。命车骑将军羊祜、荆州刺史杨肇，往赴救阐","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
